Licensing status
================

No blanket license is assigned by this packaging draft. The project owner must
choose a license for newly authored documentation and scripts before publication.
Dashboard provenance and rights must be confirmed before its source is imported.
MonLink's exact upstream version, notices and license must be reviewed before a
derived patch is distributed. No complete MonLink program is included.
Existing g2_link, DPlus and MonLink retain their respective licenses and notices.
This file is a status notice, not a grant of permission or a standard license.
